<!-- Screen Header -->
<header class="mb-section-gap">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="w-2 h-2 bg-primary rounded-full animate-pulse-gentle"></span>
                    STEWARDSHIP CENTER
                </span>
<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg font-bold text-on-surface">Community Growth &amp; Documents</h2>
<p class="text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl">Manage your outreach strategies and legal frameworks with clarity. Generate high-impact communication and secure stewardship agreements.</p>
</div>
</header>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter lg:gap-8">
<!-- Tool Section: Email Generation -->
<section class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6">
<div class="glass-panel inner-glow rounded-xl p-6 luma-glow transition-all duration-300">
<div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary">campaign</span>
</div>
<div>
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md font-semibold text-on-surface">Partner Outreach</h3>
<p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm">Automated communication composer</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="space-y-4 mb-6">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
<label class="text-xs font-label-sm text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-wider">Partner Type</label>
<select class="bg-surface-container border-b border-outline-variant focus:border-primary focus:ring-0 text-on-surface py-2 rounded-t-lg">
<option>Eco-Conservation Agency</option>
<option>Private Land Steward</option>
<option>Educational Institution</option>
<option>Community Collective</option>
</select>
</div>
<button class="w-full py-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-primary-container to-on-primary-fixed-variant text-on-primary font-bold rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 active:scale-[0.98] hover:shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(78,222,163,0.3)] flex items-center justify-center gap-2" id="btn-generate-email">
<span>Generate partner outreach email</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">auto_awesome</span>
</button>
</div>
<div class="relative group h-96" id="email-result">
<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-surface-container-lowest/50 rounded-lg border border-white/5 p-4 custom-scrollbar overflow-y-auto">
<div class="h-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center opacity-40" id="email-placeholder">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl mb-2">edit_note</span>
<p class="text-sm">Click the button above to draft <br/> a tailored partnership proposal.</p>
</div>
<div class="hidden text-sm leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant space-y-4 font-body-md" id="email-content">
<div class="p-3 bg-primary/5 border-l-2 border-primary rounded-r-md">
<span class="text-primary font-bold">Subject:</span> Potential Stewardship Collaboration - LumaNation Network
                                </div>
<p>Dear Conservation Director,</p>
<p>I am reaching out on behalf of LumaNation to discuss a potential stewardship alignment between our organizations. We have been closely following your work in restorative ecology and believe there is a significant opportunity for integrated digital-physical forest management.</p>
<p>Our platform facilitates seamless resource sharing and community-led maintenance of sensitive ecosystems. By joining our "Stewardship Tier," your agency would gain access to:</p>
<ul class="list-disc ml-4 space-y-1">
<li>Real-time atmospheric monitoring data.</li>
<li>Automated volunteer coordination frameworks.</li>
<li>Secured funding pipelines for long-term restoration.</li>
</ul>
<p>I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how we can leverage the LumaNation infrastructure to support your local initiatives. Are you available for a brief introductory call next Tuesday or Wednesday?</p>
<p>Best regards,<br/>[Your Name]<br/>LumaNation Steward</p>
</div>
</div>
<button class="absolute top-2 right-2 p-2 bg-surface-variant/80 rounded-md hover:bg-primary/20 transition-colors hidden group-hover:block border border-white/10">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">content_copy</span>
</button>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Tool Section: Document Management -->
<section class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6">
<div class="glass-panel inner-glow rounded-xl p-6 luma-glow transition-all duration-300 h-full flex flex-col">
<div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary">description</span>
</div>
<div>
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md font-semibold text-on-surface">Asset Escrow</h3>
<p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm">Secure document generation</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
<label class="text-xs font-label-sm text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-wider">Asset Value</label>
<input class="bg-surface-container border-b border-outline-variant focus:border-primary focus:ring-0 text-on-surface py-2 px-3 rounded-t-lg" placeholder="e.g. $15,000" type="text"/>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
<label class="text-xs font-label-sm text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-wider">Duration</label>
<select class="bg-surface-container border-b border-outline-variant focus:border-primary focus:ring-0 text-on-surface py-2 rounded-t-lg">
<option>12 Months</option>
<option>24 Months</option>
<option>Indefinite</option>
</select>
</div>
<button class="col-span-2 py-4 bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container font-bold rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 active:scale-[0.98] hover:bg-secondary-container/80 flex items-center justify-center gap-2" id="btn-generate-doc">
<span>Create mock escrow document</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">verified_user</span>
</button>
</div>
<div class="flex-grow relative bg-white/5 rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-white/5" id="doc-result">
<div class="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center opacity-40" id="doc-placeholder">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl mb-2">history_edu</span>
<p class="text-sm">Ready to generate <br/> legal framework preview.</p>
</div>
<div class="hidden h-full flex flex-col" id="doc-content">
<div class="bg-surface-bright/50 p-4 border-b border-white/10 flex justify-between items-center">
<span class="font-label-sm text-xs text-primary">DRAFT_ESCROW_V04.PDF</span>
<div class="flex gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm opacity-50 cursor-pointer hover:opacity-100">print</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm opacity-50 cursor-pointer hover:opacity-100">download</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="p-6 text-[10px] uppercase font-label-sm leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar flex-grow bg-surface-container-lowest">
<div class="text-center mb-8">
<h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-on-surface underline">STEWARDSHIP ASSET ESCROW AGREEMENT</h4>
<p class="mt-2 italic">Strictly Confidential - For Review Only</p>
</div>
<div class="space-y-4">
<div>
<p class="font-bold text-on-surface">1. DEFINITIONS</p>
<p class="mt-1">"Asset" refers to the digital-biological ecosystem footprint defined in Schedule A. "Escrow Agent" refers to the LumaNation DAO Protocol.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="font-bold text-on-surface">2. DEPOSIT OF ASSET</p>
<p class="mt-1">The Steward shall deposit the Stewardship Rights into the Escrow Account within 48 hours of execution of this Agreement. The DAO shall verify the integrity of the biometric lock-ins.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="font-bold text-on-surface">3. RELEASE CONDITIONS</p>
<p class="mt-1">The Asset shall be released only upon the verification of "Net-Positive Ecology Gains" sustained over three consecutive lunar cycles, verified via autonomous aerial telemetry.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="font-bold text-on-surface">4. GOVERNING LAW</p>
<p class="mt-1">This agreement is governed by the Digital Sanctuary Statutes of 2024 and sub-spatial contract law of the LumaNation ecosystem.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</div>
<!-- Secondary Insights / Bento Area -->
<div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-gutter">
<div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-4">
<div class="text-primary">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl">partner_exchange</span>
</div>
<div>
<p class="text-2xl font-bold">14</p>
<p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant">Active Proposals</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-4">
<div class="text-primary">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl">folder_managed</span>
</div>
<div>
<p class="text-2xl font-bold">32</p>
<p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant">Locked Documents</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-4">
<div class="text-primary">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl">energy_savings_leaf</span>
</div>
<div>
<p class="text-2xl font-bold">890h</p>
<p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant">Impact Time</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
